id=\"about\" class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-5xl text-center\">\n                <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-[#1A202C] relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-8 m-0\">Engineering Excellence for Lloyd AC Systems</h2>\n                <div class=\"space-y-6 text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-justify md:text-center mt-12 m-0\">\n                    <p>\n                        Lloyd air conditioners are known for their intelligent cooling and heavy-duty performance. However, Vadodara&#8217;s unique climate—marked by fine industrial dust and high humidity—requires a specialized maintenance approach to keep these machines running at 100% capacity. Atlas Aircon was established to provide an <strong>independent Lloyd AC service center Vadodara</strong> trusts for technical mastery and honest work ethics.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        Today&#8217;s AC units are sophisticated electronic systems. Fixing a modern Lloyd inverter split or a specialized <strong>Lloyd panel AC</strong> used in industrial zones like Makarpura requires a deep technical grasp of logic boards and refrigerant pressure management. Whether you&#8217;re dealing with a compressor that won&#8217;t kick on at night, need an <strong>emergency Lloyd AC repair in Vasna Road Vadodara</strong>, or require rapid maintenance for a CNC electrical cabinet cooling unit, our technicians have the on-ground experience to fix it properly.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        We operate on a &#8220;clarity first&#8221; policy. Many customers fear they will be sold parts they don&#8217;t actually need. We do things differently. We provide a complete <strong>Lloyd AC repair charges Vadodara</strong> breakdown before we begin any work. We explain the technical fault in plain language and give you a fixed quote. Experience the peace of mind that comes with hiring an independent squad that values your comfort over corporate quotas.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"services\" class=\"py-16 bg-gray-50 rounded-3xl my-12\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n                    <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-[#1A202C] relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6 m-0\">Our Core Technical Services</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-4 m-0\">From domestic troubleshooting to critical industrial cooling overhauls.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-10 m-0\">\n                    <article class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 shadow-lg group transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2.5 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                        <div class=\"relative h-56 overflow-hidden m-0\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#1A202C]/20 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10 m-0\"></div>\n                            <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700 m-0\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/ac-repairing-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"General Lloyd AC Repair Vadodara\" onerror=\"handleImageError(this)\" title=\"\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col h-[calc(100%-14rem)] m-0\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] text-2xl mb-6 shadow-sm m-0\"><i class=\"fas fa-tools m-0\"></i></div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-3 mt-0\">General Troubleshooting</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6 line-clamp-3 text-sm m-0\">If your Lloyd unit is leaking, not cooling enough, or just dead, we provide scientific diagnostics. We specialize in <strong>Lloyd split AC repair Vadodara</strong>, ensuring that every relay and motor is brought back to performance standards.</p>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mt-auto m-0\">\n                                <span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#D4AF37] m-0\">From ₹399</span>\n                                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#1A202C] font-semibold hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors flex items-center no-underline m-0\">Call Now <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt ml-2 text-sm m-0\"></i></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n\n                    <article class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 shadow-lg group transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2.5 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                        <div class=\"relative h-56 overflow-hidden bg-[#1A202C] flex items-center justify-center m-0\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-industry text-6xl text-[#D4AF37] opacity-80 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700 m-0\"></i>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col h-[calc(100%-14rem)] m-0\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] text-2xl mb-6 shadow-sm m-0\"><i class=\"fas fa-server m-0\"></i></div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-3 mt-0\">Industrial Panel AC Repair</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6 line-clamp-3 text-sm m-0\">CNC machine panels and server electrical enclosures produce intense internal heat. Our engineers provide expert <strong>Lloyd panel AC repair Vadodara</strong> in GIDC areas to prevent machinery from overheating and shutting down your production lines.</p>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mt-auto m-0\">\n                                <span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#D4AF37] m-0\">From ₹1500</span>\n                                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#1A202C] font-semibold hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors flex items-center no-underline m-0\">Call Now <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt ml-2 text-sm m-0\"></i></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n\n                    <article class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 shadow-lg group transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2.5 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                        <div class=\"relative h-56 overflow-hidden m-0\">\n                            <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700 m-0\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Ac-circuit.webp\" alt=\"Component level Lloyd AC PCB Repair Vadodara\" title=\"\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col h-[calc(100%-14rem)] m-0\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] text-2xl mb-6 shadow-sm m-0\"><i class=\"fas fa-microchip m-0\"></i></div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-3 mt-0\">PCB Motherboard Repair</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6 line-clamp-3 text-sm m-0\">Why buy an expensive new board? We provide component-level <strong>Lloyd AC PCB repair Vadodara</strong>. We fix faulty regulators and burnt circuits on your original board, saving you up to 70% compared to a full board replacement.</p>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mt-auto m-0\">\n                                <span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#D4AF37] m-0\">From ₹1500</span>\n                                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#1A202C] font-semibold hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors flex items-center no-underline m-0\">Call Now <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt ml-2 text-sm m-0\"></i></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"guide\" class=\"py-16 bg-white relative overflow-hidden\">\n            <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 w-1/3 h-full bg-yellow-50/50 skew-x-12 transform origin-top-right z-0\"></div>\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 max-w-6xl m-0\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16 m-0\">\n                    <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-[#1A202C] relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6 m-0 text-[#1A202C]\">Guidance for Lloyd AC Longevity</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-4 m-0\">Maintaining a modern machine is simple if you follow these basic HVAC engineering protocols.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"space-y-12 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-lg text-justify md:text-left m-0\">\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-4 flex items-center mt-0\"><i class=\"fas fa-wind text-blue-500 mr-3 m-0\"></i> 1. The Myth of &#8220;Gas Topping&#8221;</h3>\n                        <p class=\"mb-4 m-0\">\n                            Refrigerant gas exists in a hermetically sealed system. It does not get &#8220;consumed&#8221; like petrol in a car. If your unit is low on gas, it absolutely means there is a physical hole. Simply refilling it without fixing the leak is a waste of your money.\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"m-0\">\n                            Our protocol for <strong>Lloyd AC gas filling in Vadodara</strong> involves a nitrogen pressure test to find the hole, silver-brazing it shut, and then refilling the exact weight of refrigerant recommended by the manufacturer. This is the only way to ensure permanent cooling.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-4 flex items-center mt-0\"><i class=\"fas fa-bolt text-red-500 mr-3 m-0\"></i> 2. Surviving Voltage Fluctuations</h3>\n                        <p class=\"mb-4 m-0\">\n                            Lloyd inverter models are efficient but highly sensitive to power swings. A sudden spike in the local power grid can instantly fry a logic component on the PCB. While stabilizers help, they aren&#8217;t foolproof.\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"m-0\">\n                            If your unit won&#8217;t turn on after a storm, don&#8217;t assume the board is dead. Our experts fix specific burnt points on the board, keeping your original hardware active and saving you from a massive replacement bill.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"py-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-3xl my-12 shadow-2xl\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-6xl py-12 m-0\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16 m-0\">\n                    <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-white relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6 m-0 text-white\">Diagnostic Fault Guide</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-400 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-6 m-0\">Is your display flashing letters? Here is a guide to common <strong>Lloyd AC error codes</strong> to help you understand the fault.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"bg-gray-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-700 m-0\">\n                    <div class=\"overflow-x-auto m-0\">\n                        <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse m-0 text-sm md:text-base\">\n                            <thead>\n                                <tr class=\"bg-gray-950 text-gray-300 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider\">\n                                    <th class=\"p-6 font-semibold w-1/6 border-b border-gray-800\">Display Code</th>\n                                    <th class=\"p-6 font-semibold w-1/3 border-b border-gray-800\">Technical Fault</th>\n                                    <th class=\"p-6 font-semibold w-1/2 border-b border-gray-800\">Required Protocol</th>\n                                </tr>\n                            </thead>\n                            <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-gray-700 text-base\">\n                                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors\">\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-black text-[#D4AF37] text-xl\">CF</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-medium text-gray-300 m-0\">Filter Restriction</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 text-gray-400 m-0\">Airflow is blocked. Clean your filters immediately. If the code stays, the internal fan blower is likely choked and needs a professional jet wash.</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors bg-gray-800/30\">\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-black text-[#D4AF37] text-xl\">E1 / 21</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-medium text-gray-300 m-0\">Thermal Sensor Fault</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 text-gray-400 m-0\">The sensor measuring room heat has shorted. The AC doesn&#8217;t know when to cool. Requires a quick <strong>Lloyd AC sensor repair</strong>.</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors\">\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-black text-[#D4AF37] text-xl\">EC</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-medium text-gray-300 m-0\">Pressure Failure (Leak)</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 text-gray-400 m-0\">The machine senses low gas levels. Turn the AC off right away so the compressor doesn&#8217;t burn out, and call us for proper leak testing.</td>\n                                </tr>\n                            </tbody>\n                        </table>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"pricing\" class=\"py-16 bg-white m-0\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-5xl m-0\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16 m-0\">\n  